From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:53:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(plugins): agent_turn_start/end hooks and a
 running-subagent snapshot

agent_turn_start and agent_turn_end bracket every admitted
AIAgent.run_conversation turn; the end fires in the facade's finally, so
early returns and exceptions that skip finalize_turn (and with it
post_llm_call and on_session_end) still close the bracket.

SubagentLifecycleService.list_active() returns immutable snapshots of
every running delegated child, with its own and its parent's session id,
and steer_active() steers one by id, so plugins no longer read
tools.delegate_tool_registry internals.
